        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: কিংবদন্তি",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "কিংবদন্তি — kingbôdônti — \"a legend\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "গ্রামের একটা কিংবদন্তি আছে যে পাহাড়ের গুহায় এক রাজা থাকতেন। grāmer ekṭā kingbôdônti āchhe je pāhāṛer guhāy ek rājā thākten. There's a village legend that a king once lived in the cave in the hills."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "কিংবদন্তি (kingbôdônti) is Sanskrit kiṃvadantī, 'what do they say?' — a common saying, a rumour, a tradition (Monier-Williams). A legend is what people say."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
