          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "রূপকথা (rūpkôthā) is usually explained as রূপ, 'form, beauty' — Sanskrit rūpa, 'outward appearance' (Monier-Williams) — joined to কথা, a story: a tale of wonders."
